<div style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; color: #222; max-width: 640px;">
    <p><strong>Dear Imran (Accounts team),</strong></p>

    <p>
        Please use the pre-filled forms attached below to prepare the following Bank Guarantee.<br>
        The purpose of the Bank Guarantee is <strong>{{data.bgPurpose}}</strong>.
    </p>

    <div style="border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:8px; padding:14px 16px; background:#fafafa; margin:10px 0 16px;">
        <p style="margin:0 0 8px;"><strong>Please prepare the BG using the details below:</strong></p>
        <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;">
            <tr>
                <td style="width:220px; padding:3px 0; text-align:left; font-weight:bold; white-space:nowrap; vertical-align:top;">BG in favor of</td>
                <td style="width:8px; padding:3px 0; text-align:left; font-weight:bold; vertical-align:top;">:</td>
                <td style="padding:3px 0 3px 10px; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;">{{data.beneficiaryName}}</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td style="width:220px; padding:3px 0; text-align:left; font-weight:bold; white-space:nowrap; vertical-align:top;">BG address</td>
                <td style="width:8px; padding:3px 0; text-align:left; font-weight:bold; vertical-align:top;">:</td>
                <td style="padding:3px 0 3px 10px; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;">{{data.beneficiaryAddress}}</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td style="width:220px; padding:3px 0; text-align:left; font-weight:bold; white-space:nowrap; vertical-align:top;">BG Expiry Date</td>
                <td style="width:8px; padding:3px 0; text-align:left; font-weight:bold; vertical-align:top;">:</td>
                <td style="padding:3px 0 3px 10px; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;">{{data.bgExpiryDate}}</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td style="width:220px; padding:3px 0; text-align:left; font-weight:bold; white-space:nowrap; vertical-align:top;">BG Claim Date</td>
                <td style="width:8px; padding:3px 0; text-align:left; font-weight:bold; vertical-align:top;">:</td>
                <td style="padding:3px 0 3px 10px; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;">{{data.claimDate}}</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td style="width:220px; padding:3px 0; text-align:left; font-weight:bold; white-space:nowrap; vertical-align:top;">Amount</td>
                <td style="width:8px; padding:3px 0; text-align:left; font-weight:bold; vertical-align:top;">:</td>
                <td style="padding:3px 0 3px 10px; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;">Rs. {{data.amount}}</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td style="width:220px; padding:3px 0; text-align:left; font-weight:bold; white-space:nowrap; vertical-align:top;">BG Stamp paper value</td>
                <td style="width:8px; padding:3px 0; text-align:left; font-weight:bold; vertical-align:top;">:</td>
                <td style="padding:3px 0 3px 10px; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;">Rs. {{data.stampPaperValue}}</td>
            </tr>
            {{#if data.hasBgFormat}}
            <tr>
                <td style="width:220px; padding:3px 0; text-align:left; font-weight:bold; white-space:nowrap; vertical-align:top;">BG Format (Tender executive)</td>
                <td style="width:8px; padding:3px 0; text-align:left; font-weight:bold; vertical-align:top;">:</td>
                <td style="padding:3px 0 3px 10px; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;">attached.</td>
            </tr>
            {{/if}}
            {{#if data.hasSupportingDoc}}
            <tr>
                <td style="width:220px; padding:3px 0; text-align:left; font-weight:bold; white-space:nowrap; vertical-align:top;">{{data.supportingDocLabel}}</td>
                <td style="width:8px; padding:3px 0; text-align:left; font-weight:bold; vertical-align:top;">:</td>
                <td style="padding:3px 0 3px 10px; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;">attached.</td>
            </tr>
            {{/if}}
        </table>
    </div>

    <div style="border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:8px; padding:14px 16px; background:#fafafa; margin:10px 0 16px;">
        <p style="margin:0 0 8px;"><strong>Beneficiary Account details:</strong></p>
        <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;">
            <tr>
                <td style="width:220px; padding:3px 0; text-align:left; font-weight:bold; white-space:nowrap; vertical-align:top;">Beneficiary Name</td>
                <td style="width:8px; padding:3px 0; text-align:left; font-weight:bold; vertical-align:top;">:</td>
                <td style="padding:3px 0 3px 10px; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;">{{data.beneName}}</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td style="width:220px; padding:3px 0; text-align:left; font-weight:bold; white-space:nowrap; vertical-align:top;">Account No.</td>
                <td style="width:8px; padding:3px 0; text-align:left; font-weight:bold; vertical-align:top;">:</td>
                <td style="padding:3px 0 3px 10px; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;">{{data.beneAcc}}</td>
            </tr>
            {{#if data.beneIfsc}}
            <tr>
                <td style="width:220px; padding:3px 0; text-align:left; font-weight:bold; white-space:nowrap; vertical-align:top;">IFSC code</td>
                <td style="width:8px; padding:3px 0; text-align:left; font-weight:bold; vertical-align:top;">:</td>
                <td style="padding:3px 0 3px 10px; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;">{{data.beneIfsc}}</td>
            </tr>
            {{/if}}
            <tr>
                <td style="width:220px; padding:3px 0; text-align:left; font-weight:bold; white-space:nowrap; vertical-align:top;">Unique Code</td>
                <td style="width:8px; padding:3px 0; text-align:left; font-weight:bold; vertical-align:top;">:</td>
                <td style="padding:3px 0 3px 10px; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;">{{data.uniqueCode}}</td>
            </tr>
        </table>
    </div>

    <p>This BG is required within <strong>{{data.timeLimit}}</strong> Hrs.</p>

    <p>
        Please review the BG format, if accepted, send a request to the bank using the
        <a href="{{data.stage1Link}}">Stage 1: Request to Bank</a>. If Corrections are required,
        reject the request and mention the corrections needed.
    </p>

    <p>
        Please courier the BG to the address below keeping sufficient margin for the courier delivery
        time to ensure the BG reaches before the <strong>{{data.dueDateTime}}</strong> and share the
        SOFT COPY of the BG and the Docket slip along with SFMS confirmation with us on time using
        the form <a href="{{data.actionLink}}">Stage 2: After BG Creation</a> or your dashboard:
    </p>

    <p>
        <strong>Courier Address:</strong><br>
        {{data.courierAddress}}
    </p>

    <p>Please attach the cover letter with the bank guarantee when you courier the BG. (Attached below)</p>

    <p style="font-style: italic;">“Ensuring timely operations is the only source of growth.”</p>

    <p>
        <strong>Regards,</strong><br>
        {{#if data.senderName}}{{data.senderName}},<br>{{/if}}
        Tender executive,<br>
        Approved by Team Leader
    </p>

    {{#if data.attachmentLinks.length}}
    <p><strong>Documents</strong></p>
    <ul>
        {{#each data.attachmentLinks}}
        <li><a href="{{this.url}}">{{this.label}}</a></li>
        {{/each}}
    </ul>
    {{/if}}
</div>
